<title>SWEDEN: Forcenergy Inc completes Alaska field buy.</title>
<headline>Forcenergy Inc completes Alaska field buy.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil company Forcenergy Inc said on Thursday it had completed the acquisition of Stewart Petroleum Co's and other interests in West McArthur River Field in Alaska.</p>
</text>
